###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}6\blueE{t}+1\blueE{t}+\goldE{7}-\goldE{2}
\\\\
&=(6+1)\blueE{t}+\goldE{7}-\goldE{2}
\\\\
&=7\blueE{t}+\goldE{5}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $7\blueE{t}+\goldE{5}$ since they aren't like terms.
